### Operator 领取车辆20的验车任务
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/3/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}

###

### Operator 提交车辆20验车通过
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/3/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "result": "Passed",
  "resultNotes": "Vehicle condition is normal."
}



### Operator 领取车辆23的验车任务
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/4/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}

###

### Operator 提交车辆23验车失败
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/4/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "result": "Failed",
  "resultNotes": "Brake performance abnormal. Maintenance required."
}




### V3.3.8 Operator 领取车辆23维修任务
POST http://localhost:5129/api/maintenances/2/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}


### V3.3.8 提交车辆23维修完成申请
POST http://localhost:5129/api/maintenances/2/submit-repair
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repairNotes": "Brake components replaced. Brake performance tested and confirmed.",
  "repairCost": 650.00
}



### V3.3.8 Admin 复核车辆23维修通过
POST http://localhost:5129/api/maintenances/2/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true,
  "verificationNotes": "Brake system inspection passed. Vehicle cleared for operation."
}




